      "side": 1,
      "message": "With less CPU idleness though, do we know the actual impact on power usage?  Wouldn\u0027t this change depend on were in the energy model curve we are?  meaning at the higher end increasing the freq is likely more costly but not at lower end?",
      "revId": "09c339096a04122c752d792a499d907dbd574a29",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
