      "writtenOn": "2017-08-11T22:05:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah.\n(just thinking out loud...) I believe if we could do energy diff on all CPUs during target selection, then we wouldn\u0027t have this issue? Doesn\u0027t this stem from that? EM would tell us if its more energy eff. or not?\n\nso if !(boosted \u0026\u0026 prefer_idle), we should do ediff on all CPUs, find out what\u0027s the best option and choose that as the target. Instead we do it the other way now, we choose the target first, and then do the energy diff..",
